{"id":"0a585a933cab3c7c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FEncodeTerm.md","title":"FEncodeTerm","display":"FEncodeTerm","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FEncodeTerm","parameters":["F","f","g","t","u"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FEncodeTerm"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>f</span><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>u</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶 alpha 编码。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>u</code>。</p>\n<p>变量栈最近绑定优先；外部自由名编码为栈长加名字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FEncodeTerm F f g t u)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z4891 (@ FEncodeTermProof F f g t u z4891))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"23a114c607c9e668\" href=\"?note=23a114c607c9e668\" title=\"ZFC_FEncodeTermProof\">FEncodeTermProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FEncodeTerm F f g t u)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FEncodeTermProof","status":"resolved","id":"23a114c607c9e668","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FEncodeTermProof|FEncodeTermProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":829,"backlinks":[{"id":"b7e69cae674ee491","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FEncodeTerm|FEncodeTerm]]"},{"id":"c3476af232a14478","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Cons|Cons]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FEncodeTerm|FEncodeTerm]]；[[ZFC_FEq|FEq]]；[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FNamelessAll|FNamelessAll]]；[[ZFC_FRel|FRel]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_SeqTo|SeqTo]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-755","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_FEncodeTerm|FEncodeTerm]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","23a114c607c9e668","593f9bdab4d60707"]}